{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-020",
    "title": "旧墟落雪"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_109",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“先找到他。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "石门缝隙里的白光越来越亮。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3279,
          "end": 3279
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在门前，耳边仍回荡着陆沉舟的声音。顾长离和叶观澜一左一右守着他，慧闻则退到灯柱阴影中，手里的无相铜镜微微倾斜，像在等待某个无法预料的结果。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3281,
          "end": 3281
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临。”门内再次传来声音，“别进来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3283,
          "end": 3283
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这一次，声音里有明显的疲惫。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3285,
          "end": 3285
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临握紧半枚残印：“你是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3287,
          "end": 3287
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内沉默了很久。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3289,
          "end": 3289
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你父亲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3291,
          "end": 3291
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你记得北河城吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3293,
          "end": 3293
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3295,
          "end": 3295
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“门口的老槐树呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3297,
          "end": 3297
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“树冠朝南，枝干中间有一道雷劈的疤。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3299,
          "end": 3299
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临的呼吸停住了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3301,
          "end": 3301
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是他刚刚想起，又差点再次失去的细节。若门内的声音知道它，便可能真是陆沉舟；可太虚遗脉能够借用被夺走的记忆，这个答案仍不足以证明身份。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3303,
          "end": 3303
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离低声道：“问他只有你们知道的事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3305,
          "end": 3305
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“你离开那天，给我留下了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3307,
          "end": 3307
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一盏坏掉的灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3309,
          "end": 3309
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯里有什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3311,
          "end": 3311
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“没有灯芯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3313,
          "end": 3313
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是陆照临与父亲之间最早的记忆。那盏灯被他拆开过无数次，里面确实没有灯芯。可他从未告诉过任何人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3315,
          "end": 3315
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜皱眉：“打开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3317,
          "end": 3317
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻摇头：“身份只能证明记忆相同，不能证明人仍然完整。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3319,
          "end": 3319
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "黑铁门上的字迹开始剥落。门后传来拖行声，像有人正把沉重灯架移到门边。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3321,
          "end": 3321
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“照临，”陆沉舟说，“第二盏灯不能醒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3323,
          "end": 3323
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临手中的灯：“它已经在醒了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3325,
          "end": 3325
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯罩内的金光从缝隙中溢出，照亮石厅。门内的人影终于出现，身形高瘦，披着旧灰斗篷，手里提着一盏青色长灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3327,
          "end": 3327
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临一眼认出那件斗篷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3329,
          "end": 3329
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三年前父亲离开北河城时，穿的就是这件。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3331,
          "end": 3331
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“父亲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3333,
          "end": 3333
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "人影停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3335,
          "end": 3335
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有立刻走出门，只把长灯放在地上。灯火照亮他的脸，脸庞仍是陆照临记忆里的样子，却有一半被青色纹路覆盖。纹路从眉骨向下延伸，像有人把一张新的脸刻在旧脸上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3337,
          "end": 3337
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你长大了。”陆沉舟说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3339,
          "end": 3339
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还活着？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3341,
          "end": 3341
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“活着不是这里的规矩。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3343,
          "end": 3343
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3345,
          "end": 3345
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟低头看自己的手。指尖没有血色，掌纹里流着细细的青光。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3347,
          "end": 3347
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“引灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3349,
          "end": 3349
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜走近一步：“归墟盟的信，你送到了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3351,
          "end": 3351
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟看向他，眼神陌生：“我不认识你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3353,
          "end": 3353
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前冬至前七日，你在无灯镇收过一枚空灯牌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3355,
          "end": 3355
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得灯，不记得送灯的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3357,
          "end": 3357
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那是因为你的名字被拿走了。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3359,
          "end": 3359
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟抬头看僧人：“你们无相寺总喜欢把结果说成原因。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3361,
          "end": 3361
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻不再说话。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3363,
          "end": 3363
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把顾氏旧印举起：“你见过这个？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3365,
          "end": 3365
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟盯着旧印，脸上的青纹忽然扩散了一寸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3367,
          "end": 3367
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“见过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3369,
          "end": 3369
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁用的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3371,
          "end": 3371
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一个不肯回去的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3373,
          "end": 3373
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是我叔父？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3375,
          "end": 3375
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟没有回答。他弯腰捡起地上的长灯，灯火随之变暗。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3377,
          "end": 3377
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏的人把第二盏灯送出城，换走了三个人的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3379,
          "end": 3379
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们为什么要这么做？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3381,
          "end": 3381
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为城心已经开始吃人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3383,
          "end": 3383
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石厅上方传来一阵震动。墙上的灰白石片纷纷脱落，露出后面的黑色脉络。脉络像树根一样爬向灯柱，青光在其中奔流。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3385,
          "end": 3385
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拔刀：“城要醒了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3387,
          "end": 3387
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟看向陆照临：“把第二盏灯交给我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3389,
          "end": 3389
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内传来陆沉舟最后一句话：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3609,
          "end": 3609
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“照临，别让他们替你记住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3611,
          "end": 3611
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青铜门外，雪下得更大。归墟灵城的城墙从雾中一寸寸崩塌，第二枚残印在陆照临掌中忽明忽暗。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3613,
          "end": 3613
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处旧驿道尽头，玄霄宗的追捕令被风卷起，纸上原本没有脸的画像，渐渐浮出陆照临的五官。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3615,
          "end": 3615
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他抬头望向北方。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3617,
          "end": 3617
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方势力都已经知道他拿到了残印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3619,
          "end": 3619
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "而更远的地方，第三盏灯正在等他。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3621,
          "end": 3621
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临将两枚残印贴在一起，掌心传来一阵尖锐的疼痛。那道空白缺口像一扇没有合拢的门，门后没有光，只有不断向外涌出的冷风。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3623,
          "end": 3623
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离捡起破碎的灯罩，把仍在燃烧的灯芯踩灭。她的叔父面孔已经消失，地上只剩一小片灰烬。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3625,
          "end": 3625
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他真的让我把灯送回人间。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3627,
          "end": 3627
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会照做吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3629,
          "end": 3629
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先找到他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3631,
          "end": 3631
        }
      }
    ],
